  "body": "https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#url-syntax\n\n> A query must be zero or more URL units.\n\nThis should probably say something about encodings. Maybe make unescaped non-ASCII characters invalid in the query when the encoding isn't utf-8 (or utf-16?). And add a note/example explaining this.\n\nRelated https://github.com/htacg/tidy-html5/issues/378\n",
